      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p><strong>Trivial Physical Mutation, Tolerable</strong></p><p>Your blood becomes cool and as a result your body temperature drops to room temperature, much like a snake or a lizard. This can make you uncomfortable to touch and you gain the Vulnerability (Cold) mutation. You become coldly calculating like a serpent too - gain the Cold-blooded Creature Trait. You lose -10 Fellowship. You can only gain this mutation once.</p>"
